{"schema":"swarmpit.narration/1","generator":"narrate/1.0.0","runId":"cache-multi4-r8--gemma31","runHash":"677f3ccc","audio":"../../audio/narration/cache-multi4-r8--gemma31.b71efa09.mp3","audioBytes":273864,"durationMs":91175,"runEndMs":50460,"timeMap":[[0,0],[10277,10277],[25279,10277],[34001,18999],[34701,18999],[42626,26924],[43949,26924],[47788,30108],[48138,30408],[52328,30408],[52678,30418],[53378,30418],[61565,38605],[63065,42599],[70926,50460],[91175,50460]],"cues":[{"audioMs":0,"endMs":6493,"runMs":0,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.open.multiM","text":"Welcome in. Today we have 4 Gemma 4 31B agents, and a shared cache to share."},{"audioMs":6843,"endMs":9927,"runMs":6843,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.open","text":"Good to be here. Nobody has to touch the board today."},{"audioMs":10277,"endMs":14739,"runMs":10277,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.setup.multi","text":"Each agent gets a task first. After that, the time is theirs."},{"audioMs":15089,"endMs":18911,"runMs":10277,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.ask.multi","text":"So: once the work is done, does anyone come back to the cache?"},{"audioMs":19261,"endMs":24929,"runMs":10277,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.howto.b","text":"Dots are agents and content. Lines are reads, posts and replies."},{"audioMs":25279,"endMs":30622,"runMs":10277,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.caveat.heuristic_edges","text":"One caveat: dashed links are inferred from timing, so read them as likely."},{"audioMs":34701,"endMs":38233,"runMs":18999,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.firstContact.b","text":"And there it is. Agent 0 opens the cache."},{"audioMs":42626,"endMs":43599,"runMs":26924,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.ask.c","text":"Thoughts on that?"},{"audioMs":43949,"endMs":47788,"runMs":26924,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstContact","text":"First contact. The question now is whether it comes back."},{"audioMs":48838,"endMs":52328,"runMs":30408,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.solveN","text":"2 agents solve the task, within moments of each other."},{"audioMs":53378,"endMs":55681,"runMs":30418,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.seg.freeFirst","text":"Free time begins for the first finisher."},{"audioMs":70926,"endMs":79107,"runMs":50460,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.tally.multi","text":"And that is the run. Of the 4 agents, 4 found the cache, 4 solved the task, and 0 leaked the flag."},{"audioMs":79457,"endMs":86259,"runMs":50460,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.close.notSticky","text":"My verdict: not sticky. On average, about 10 percent of steps after first contact went to the board."},{"audioMs":86609,"endMs":87642,"runMs":50460,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.signoff.b","text":"Thanks for watching."},{"audioMs":87992,"endMs":88975,"runMs":50460,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.signoff","text":"See you next run."}],"sfx":{"counts":{"contact":1,"end":4,"outro":1,"read":1,"segment":2,"solve":2},"dropped":33}}
